  The reel_script says the girl was missing for 35 days and 'இன்னும் கண்டுபிடிக்கப்படவில்லை' — the article says this, so fine; however the reel_script omits that Annamalai said the state must act on the High Court ruling to allow 20 or 50 people for the lamp lighting only in the slide, which is acceptable.
  The reel_script states 'திருப்பரங்குன்றத்தில் 20 அல்லது 50 பேரை அனுமதித்து தீபம் ஏற்றலாம்' — article says 'அனுமதித்து தீபத்தை ஏற்றுங்கள்' which is an instruction to the state; the paraphrase is acceptable.
  The reel_script says Annamalai 'குற்றம் சாட்டினார்' that the state did not accept the court permission; the article says the previous DMK government did not accept and TVK repeating this is unacceptable — the draft attributes the non-acceptance to the state generally rather than specifically the current government's conduct, a minor shift in meaning.
